NOTE
Tips for creating good subtitles:
- Keep each cue under 2 lines
- Maximum 42 characters per line
- Display time: 1-6 seconds per cue
- Leave at least 0.2 seconds between cues
- Use proper punctuation
- Indicate speaker changes clearly
- Describe important sounds in [brackets]
- Use ♪ for music

NOTE
Supported languages on Kona:
- English (en)
- Swahili (sw)
- French (fr)

